 r Hit Me Hard and Soft 12-date arena tour of Australia to tens of thousand
 s of fans\, will kick the Smoochies Tour off in Australia in 2026. ​Ashn
 ikko has achieved some huge milestones for an artist just one album into t
 heir career\, surpassing 3.9 Billion global streams and 700 million video 
 views to date\, with hit songs ‘Slumber party (Opens in new tab)’ and 
 ‘Daisy (Opens in new tab)’. Following the release of her debut album\,
  Weedkiller\, in 2023 Ashnikko has spent the past 18 months touring across
